# Outreach Contact Surfaces

## Invariant

Preferred action target (`OutreachContactInline` — phone, email, mailing) appears on **exactly one** surface per view. Key Contact may still list all numbers as a **directory**; that is not a second `OutreachContactInline`.

Use `outreachContactPlacement()` from `frontend/src/utils/outreachContactPlacement.ts` before adding any contact UI.

| Surface | When |
|---------|------|
| `primary_task` | Primary (first sorted) open task is **call / follow-up / email / mail** — inline on that task row even when Key Contact is mounted |
| `key_contact_card` | Key Contact mounted **and** primary task is not call/email outreach |
| `recommended_action` | No open tasks **and** Key Contact card not visible — inline under RA label |
| Queue table | Compact subline only — `OutreachContactCallout compact` |

## Do not

- Import bordered `OutreachContactCallout` (non-compact) into Command Center components
- Add a standalone contact box above/below tasks separate from the task row
- Show `OutreachContactInline` in both Recommended Action panel and Open Tasks on the same page

## Do

- Embed with `OutreachContactInline` inside existing task rows or RA subtitle
- Extend `outreachContactPlacement.test.ts` and Command Center dedup tests when changing placement
- Pass `showOutreachContact` / `showOutreachContactOnPrimaryTask` from parent based on placement
